---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';

const aboutPage = {
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  '@id': 'https://foodhacks.co/about/',
  url: 'https://foodhacks.co/about/',
  name: 'About us - Food Hacks',
  about: { '@id': 'https://foodhacks.co/#organization' },
};
---

<BaseLayout title="About us - Food Hacks" schema={[aboutPage]}>
  <PageHero title="About us" subtitle="Who We Are" chapter="01" chapterName="The Idea" />

  <!-- About Food Hacks (copy verbatim) — editorial spread: photo plate left,
       running text right with a serif lede -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.75rem)]">About Food Hacks</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-12 md:mt-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8">
      <figure class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="bg-oat p-8">
          <img
            src="/images/fh-products.png"
            alt="About Food Hacks — product range"
            width="897"
            height="897"
            loading="lazy"
            class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[440px] mix-blend-multiply"
          />
        </div>
        <figcaption class="kicker mt-4">The Food Hacks range</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="space-y-5 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
        <p class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.15rem,2vw,1.4rem)] font-[440] leading-[1.55]">
          Welcome to Food Hacks, where we reinvent the art of cooking.
        </p>
        <hr class="rule-green w-12" />
        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">
          Discover the cooking spray that is changing the game of cooking. Designed to be your
          essential kitchen companion, it offers an innovative and easy solution to all your
          cooking needs.
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">
          At Food Hacks, we focus on simplifying the cooking process by offering healthy and easy
          methods. We are here to make every meal an opportunity to enjoy and experience something
          new in the kitchen.
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">
          Cook healthy and easy with Food Hacks spray. This product allows you to use a small
          amount of oil evenly, reducing mess and promoting a healthy lifestyle. Monitor your
          calorie intake effectively and enjoy delicious food without the need for large amounts
          of oil.
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">Food Hacks spray has several aspects that make it an attractive choice for many people:</p>

        <!-- the four numbered aspects, set like a recipe card's steps -->
        <ol class="!mt-8 space-y-0 border-t border-hairline">
          <li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-2 border-b border-hairline py-4">
            <span class="faq-no" aria-hidden="true">1.</span>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7]">&#8288;Ideal Size: The size of the spray allows you to use it easily in the kitchen without taking up a lot of space or being heavy.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-2 border-b border-hairline py-4">
            <span class="faq-no" aria-hidden="true">2.</span>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7]">&#8288;Non-stick Experience: Food Hacks spray is characterized by its ability to provide a non-stick cooking experience, reducing the need to use excessive oils or fats.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-2 border-b border-hairline py-4">
            <span class="faq-no" aria-hidden="true">3.</span>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7]">&#8288;Multiple Use: It can be used for several purposes in cooking, from spraying ingredients with oil to improving the overall flavor of foods.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-2 border-b border-hairline py-4">
            <span class="faq-no" aria-hidden="true">4.</span>
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7]">&#8288;Low Calories: The spray helps reduce the amount of oil or fat used, which contributes to reducing the calories in food.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">
          These features make Food Hacks spray a useful choice for those looking to improve their
          cooking experience in healthy and practical ways.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Factory (copy verbatim) — mirrored spread -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] border-t border-hairline px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.75rem)]">Our Factory</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-12 md:mt-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8">
      <div class="space-y-5 md:col-span-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.1rem,1.9vw,1.3rem)] font-[440] leading-[1.55]">
          San Ramon is a leading brand from Kuwait, known for providing world-class products and
          services. The company has an extensive distribution network that gives it a unique
          competitive advantage.
        </p>
        <hr class="rule-green w-12" />
        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">
          San Ramon was established in 2004, launching its first division in the field of producing
          oil and gas products. Then, in 2012, the company entered the food and beverage market,
          becoming the owner and manufacturer of several famous brands such as Karak Tea, Honey
          Al-Shahd, Food Hacks, and Food Experts.
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-[62ch]">
          In 2013, San Ramon expanded its portfolio to include beauty products, followed by the
          opening of the cafes and restaurants division in 2015. In 2018, the company added the
          interior design division to its portfolio, with its continuous aspirations to expand its
          scope and establish new partnerships in the near future.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="md:col-span-5 md:col-start-8">
        <img
          src="/images/san_20remon.png"
          alt="San Ramon factory"
          width="1494"
          height="940"
          loading="lazy"
          class="w-full border border-hairline"
        />
        <figcaption class="kicker mt-4 text-right">San Ramon &mdash; Kuwait, est. 2004</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
